    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2797" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Antĕrōs</span></b> ,
		ōtis, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀντέρως</span> (an opponent of Eros) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An avenger of slighted love</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D.
				3, 23, 60</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A kind of amethyst</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 37,
				9, 40, § 123</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A slave of Atticus</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Att.
				9, 14, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 1, 1</span></i>.</div>
